{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09714","headline":"蜀葵花歌 · 岑参","name":"蜀葵花歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日一花开，今日一花开。\n今日花正好，昨日花已老。\n始知人老不如花，可惜落花君莫埽。\n人生不得长少年，莫惜牀头沽酒钱。\n请君有钱向酒家，君不见，蜀葵花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09714.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09714","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}